      "text": "I. VOCABULARY: SHOPS AND SHOPPING \n\n1. Kinds of shops\n\n* These words are also for people's jobs. We often add 's and say: I'm going to the newsagent's to get a paper. Do you want anything from the butcher's? \n\n2. In the department store \n\nA department store is a large shop which sells a lot of different things – clothes, beauty products, toys, etc. \n\n3. Signs in shops\n\n4. Expressions \n\nShop assistant: Can I help you?\n\nCustomer: Can I try this shirt on? (goes and tries it on) Have you got a bigger/ smaller size/ a different colour?\n\nShop assistant: No, I'm sorry. That's the only one.\n\nCustomer: OK. I'll take it. How much does it cost?\n\nShop assistant: £17.\n\nCustomer: Can I pay by cheque?\n\nShop assistant: No, credit card or cash only.\n\nCustomer: Sorry, I only have a £50 note. I don't have any change. (coins or smaller notes)\n\nShop assistant: That's okay. Here's your receipt. Would you like a (carrier) bag?",
      "rawHtml": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important; color: #c0392b;\">I. VOCABULARY</span>: SHOPS AND SHOPPING </strong></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">1. Kinds of shops</strong></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><img src=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/images/1715742505.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"472\" height=\"181\" /></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">* These words are also for people's jobs. We often add <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">'s</em> and say: I'm going to the newsagent's to get a paper. Do you want anything from the butcher's? </span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">2. In the department store </strong></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\">A department store is a large shop which sells a lot of different things – clothes, beauty products, toys, etc. </span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><img src=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/images/1715742534.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"224\" /></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 0px !important; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">3. Signs in shops</strong></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !important;\"><img src=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/images/1715742564.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"133\" /></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0px !