      "text": "SHADOWING & USEFUL STRUCTURES \n\nCheck transcript của bài nghe challenge trước tại đây: SCRIPT\n\nHọc thuộc làu làu tất cả các câu sau (Ghi nhớ nghĩa và Nghe + bắt chước đúng ngữ âm, ngữ điệu và tốc độ)\n\n \n\n1. How much is this computer?\n\n2. Do you want to try them on?\n\n3. Only rich people can really afford to buy a car at home.\n\n4. We pay a very high tax on cars.\n\n5. I was kind of surprised that I could get nice clothes here for very reasonable prices.\n\n6. You have to pay a lot to do that, so it's a big expense for many people.\n\n7. You need to have health insurance because it costs a lot to see a doctor or to enter a hospital.",
      "rawHtml": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-ExtraBold; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ba372a; color: #ffffff;\"> SHADOWING & USEFUL STRUCTURES </span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Check transcript của bài nghe challenge trước tại đây: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1RlJUAC7NyATO5OCFdF9nFKHg8ry6cIUB16xornSaO9c/edit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SCRIPT</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Học thuộc làu làu tất cả các câu sau (Ghi nhớ nghĩa và Nghe + bắt chước đúng ngữ âm, ngữ điệu và tốc độ)</strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1715746764.mp3\" />1. How much is this computer?</p>\n<p><img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1715746777.mp3\" />2. Do you want to try them on?</p>\n<p><img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1715746790.mp3\" />3. Only rich people can really afford to buy a car at home.</p>\n<p><img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1715746816.mp3\" />4. We pay a very high tax on cars.</p>\n<p><img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1715746829.mp3\" />5. I was kind of surprised that I could get nice clothes here for very reasonable prices.</p>\n<p><img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1715746839.mp3\" />6. You have to pay a lot to do that, so it's a big expense for many people.</p>\n<p><img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1715746849.mp3\" />7. You need to have health insurance because it costs a lot to see a doctor or to enter a hospital.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
